Source: homelab-dovecot-metrics
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), perl (>= 5.40)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/permittivity2/homelab

Package: homelab-dovecot-metrics
Architecture: all
Depends: dovecot-core | dovecot-imapd
Recommends: homelab-agent, homelab-node-exporter, homelab-dovecot
Description: Dovecot native openmetrics enablement for homelab-*
 Drops a conf.d snippet enabling Dovecot 2.4's native openmetrics endpoint
 (:9900/metrics) plus a few high-value metrics, reloads Dovecot gracefully
 (a new listener only -- does not touch IMAP/LMTP), and advertises it
 (kind: metrics-exporter, :9900) so homelab-prometheus discovers + scrapes
 it. Install on each homelab-dovecot (mailstore) host.
